{"seq":1,"slug":"formation-theory","title":"行星形成理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/exoplanets/formation/formation-theory","wordCount":1612,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"行星形成理论\">行星形成理论</h1><p>行星不是凭空出现的，而是恒星诞生时残留的那一圈气体与尘埃——原行星盘（protoplanetary disk）——在一千万年量级里逐步「装配」出来的。问题在于：从微米级的尘埃颗粒到木星这样的庞然大物，跨越了 13 个数量级的尺度，中间每一步都有理论上的「卡点」。本节讲行星形成的主线理论：尘埃如何聚成星子、星子如何长成行星核、巨行星如何抓住气体包层，以及核吸积与盘不稳定两条相互竞争的路径。形成位置如何造就不同行星类型由<a href=\"planet-diversity\">行星类型与多样性</a>主讲，本节聚焦「怎么形成」的机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>行星形成是一条尺度逐级放大的装配线，每一阶段由不同的物理过程主导，并各有需要跨越的障碍。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[原行星盘 气体加尘埃] --&gt; B[尘埃碰撞黏附&lt;br/&gt;长到毫米厘米]&#10;  B --&gt; C[米级障碍&lt;br/&gt;径向漂移与碰撞破碎]&#10;  C --&gt; D[流动不稳定性&lt;br/&gt;尘埃聚团直接坍缩成星子]&#10;  D --&gt; E[星子吸积长成行星核]&#10;  E --&gt; F{核质量是否够大}&#10;  F --&gt;|够大且气体未散| G[失控气体吸积成巨行星]&#10;  F --&gt;|不够或气体已散| H[岩石或冰质行星]\">flowchart TD\n  A[原行星盘 气体加尘埃] --&gt; B[尘埃碰撞黏附&lt;br/&gt;长到毫米厘米]\n  B --&gt; C[米级障碍&lt;br/&gt;径向漂移与碰撞破碎]\n  C --&gt; D[流动不稳定性&lt;br/&gt;尘埃聚团直接坍缩成星子]\n  D --&gt; E[星子吸积长成行星核]\n  E --&gt; F{核质量是否够大}\n  F --&gt;|够大且气体未散| G[失控气体吸积成巨行星]\n  F --&gt;|不够或气体已散| H[岩石或冰质行星]</pre><p>下表对比两条主要形成路径：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>核吸积</th>\n<th>盘不稳定</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>机制</td>\n<td>先造固体核，再吸积气体包层</td>\n<td>盘自身引力碎裂直接坍缩成团</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时标</td>\n<td>较慢（百万年量级）</td>\n<td>极快（数千年）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>偏好位置</td>\n<td>雪线内外皆可，主导内盘</td>\n<td>寒冷、大质量的外盘</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解释对象</td>\n<td>多数行星，尤其岩石与近距巨行星</td>\n<td>部分宽轨道大质量巨行星</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要难点</td>\n<td>须在气体散失前造出足够大的核</td>\n<td>要求盘足够重且冷</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"从尘埃到星子-跨越米级障碍\">从尘埃到星子：跨越米级障碍</h2><p>最初一步看似简单：原行星盘里的微米尘埃在湍流中碰撞、靠范德华力黏附，逐渐长大。但当颗粒长到约一米尺度，两个致命问题同时出现。其一是径向漂移——米级石块受到盘气体的迎面阻力，在不到一千年的时间里就会螺旋落入恒星，根本来不及继续长大。其二是碰撞速度随尺寸上升，米级石块相撞往往破碎而非黏合。这道「米级障碍」（meter-size barrier）曾长期是理论的死结。</p>\n<p>当前主流解法是流动不稳定性（streaming instability）：尘埃与气体的相对运动会自发触发不稳定，使固体颗粒局部聚集成密集的「尘埃流」，密度高到自身引力足以直接坍缩，一步跨过米级尺度，生成公里级的星子（planetesimal）。这绕开了「逐颗黏合」的困境，是近年形成理论的关键进展。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核吸积-主流路径\">核吸积：主流路径</h2><p>星子形成后，靠引力相互吸积、合并，逐步长成行星胚胎乃至行星核。这一阶段存在「失控增长」：越大的天体引力截面越大、吸积越快，强者愈强。核吸积（core accretion）理论认为，行星核长到约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>M</mi><mo>⊕</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\,M_\\oplus</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⊕</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时，引力强到能从盘中俘获并维持一层氢氦气体包层。</p>\n<p>关键的物理是临界核质量与气体吸积的竞速：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>core</mtext></msub><mo>≳</mo><mn>10</mn><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>M</mi><mo>⊕</mo></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>失控气体吸积</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{\\text{core}} \\gtrsim 10\\,M_\\oplus \\;\\Rightarrow\\; \\text{失控气体吸积}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9592em;vertical-align:-0.2296em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">core</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel amsrm\">≳</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⊕</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">失控气体吸积</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>一旦越过这个临界值，包层无法靠自身压力支撑，气体便失控涌入，在短时间内堆出木星这样的气态巨行星。但这里有一场与时间的赛跑：原行星盘的气体通常在几百万年内被恒星辐射吹散，核必须在气体散失前长够大，否则只能停留在岩石或冰质行星阶段。这场赛跑的结果——核长得多快、何时越过临界质量——直接决定一个系统里巨行星与小行星的比例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"盘不稳定-另一条快车道\">盘不稳定：另一条快车道</h2><p>核吸积有个软肋：在遥远、低密度的外盘，星子吸积慢得可能赶不上气体散失，难以解释某些宽轨道的大质量巨行星。盘不稳定（disk instability，又称引力不稳定）提供了另一条路：若盘本身足够大、足够冷，其自引力会压倒压力与剪切的稳定作用，盘直接碎裂成自束缚的气体团块，在数千年内坍缩成巨行星，完全跳过「先造核」的步骤。</p>\n<p>判断盘是否会碎裂的判据是图米（Toomre）参数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mi>κ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi>G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>Q</mi><mo>≲</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>盘失稳碎裂</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q = \\frac{c_s \\kappa}{\\pi G \\Sigma}, \\quad Q \\lesssim 1 \\;\\Rightarrow\\; \\text{盘失稳碎裂}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.7936em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel amsrm\">≲</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">盘失稳碎裂</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为声速、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span></span></span></span></span> 为本轮频率、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span></span></span></span></span> 为面密度。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 小（盘冷而重）时失稳。盘不稳定与核吸积并非互斥，而是各擅一方：核吸积主导多数行星尤其内盘，盘不稳定可能负责一小部分宽轨道、大质量的巨行星。两者共同构成形成理论的双引擎。</p>\n<h2 id=\"形成位置与雪线-身世的烙印\">形成位置与雪线：身世的烙印</h2><p>行星在盘里何处形成，深刻影响它最终是什么。雪线（snow line）是盘中水冰能否凝结的温度边界：雪线之外，水以固态冰存在，固体物质骤增，吸积更快、更易造出大核，这解释了为何巨行星倾向在雪线外形成。雪线还不止一条——不同挥发物（水、二氧化碳、一氧化碳）各有自己的凝结线，它们共同决定了行星固体与气体的成分配比。</p>\n<p>这一点把形成理论与<a href=\"../characterization/atmosphere-characterization\">大气表征</a>直接缝合：一颗行星大气的金属丰度与碳氧比，记录了它在哪条雪线内外吸积、吸积了多少冰与气——大气化学因此成为反推形成位置的化石证据。而行星形成后并不一定停在原地，盘的力矩会驱动它<a href=\"orbital-dynamics-migration\">迁移</a>，这是解释热木星等「身处错位」行星的关键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>行星形成是从微米尘埃到行星的逐级装配，跨越约 13 个数量级，每阶段各有物理卡点。</li>\n<li>米级障碍（径向漂移+碰撞破碎）由流动不稳定性破解：尘埃自发聚团直接坍缩成星子。</li>\n<li>核吸积是主流路径——星子失控增长造出约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>M</mi><mo>⊕</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\,M_\\oplus</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⊕</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的核后失控吸积气体，但须赶在盘气体散失前完成。</li>\n<li>盘不稳定提供快车道，靠盘自引力碎裂（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>≲</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q\\lesssim1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9592em;vertical-align:-0.2296em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel amsrm\">≲</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>）直接成团，主要解释宽轨道大质量巨行星。</li>\n<li>雪线决定固体丰度与形成位置，把形成史烙进行星的<a href=\"../characterization/atmosphere-characterization\">大气化学</a>，而形成后的<a href=\"orbital-dynamics-migration\">迁移</a>进一步重塑轨道。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"行星形成理论","id":"行星形成理论"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从尘埃到星子：跨越米级障碍","id":"从尘埃到星子-跨越米级障碍"},{"level":2,"text":"核吸积：主流路径","id":"核吸积-主流路径"},{"level":2,"text":"盘不稳定：另一条快车道","id":"盘不稳定-另一条快车道"},{"level":2,"text":"形成位置与雪线：身世的烙印","id":"形成位置与雪线-身世的烙印"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"行星系统结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/exoplanets/characterization/system-architecture"},"next":{"title":"行星类型与多样性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/exoplanets/formation/planet-diversity"}}